category: Libs
requires: libosip2_15 pkg-config
sdesc: "Implementation of SIP (development)"
ldesc: "oSIP is an LGPL implementation of SIP. It's stable, portable, flexible and
compliant! -may be more-! It is used mostly with eXosip2 stack (GPL) which
provides simpler API for User-Agent implementation."
external-source: libosip2

